A '''Tool Exp Capsule''' is a {{Rare}} item.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Tool Exp Capsule''' can be obtained from a max level [[Farming Tool]]. Upon reaching level {{Green|50}}, all experience gained goes towards a '''Tool Exp Capsule'''. After reaching {{Green|200,000}} experience, the progress resets and the player is given a '''Tool Exp Capsule''', and the following message will appear:
{{TextSection|boxed=true|text={{Dialogue|&3&lOVERFLOW! &7Your <tool> has just dropped a &9Tool Exp Capsule&7!}}}}

== Usage ==
A '''Tool Exp Capsule''' can be applied to any specialized Farming Tool to gain {{Green|100,000}} tool XP.

=== Combining ===
{{AnvilSB|Input2=Tool Exp Capsule}}

== Trivia ==
* To get a tool from level 0 to 50 with just '''Tool Exp Capsules''', it would take 494 capsules (costing {{BazaarPurchaseCalc|494 TOOL_EXP_CAPSULE}} from the [[Bazaar]]).

